Subject: [PATCH] Minimal Primus26.8 HIP launch and CXI corrections on UCCL52d4184

Keep HIP cooperative extended launch, ROCR GPU-memory registration and
consistent physical NIC/NUMA selection, including upstream fresh-info retries.
Do not add another CXI mutex or host cleanup barrier: those intents are
already covered by upstream setup serialization and topology all-gather.
ROCm10.1/Torch2.14 joint host/device codegen ablations pass without the older
min/max, volatile-snapshot and builtin-math rewrites; leave kernels unchanged.
The separate ownership patch preserves the legacy native positional API.

diff --git a/ep/include/cxi_transport.hpp b/ep/include/cxi_transport.hpp
index f90578a..a63cfc9 100644
--- a/ep/include/cxi_transport.hpp
+++ b/ep/include/cxi_transport.hpp
@@ -20,6 +20,7 @@ class CxiTransport final : public EpTransport {
   ~CxiTransport() override;

   void init(ProxyCtx& ctx) override;
+  void init(ProxyCtx& ctx, int cxi_local_rank);
   void register_main_buffer(void* ptr, size_t len, int cuda_device) override;
   void register_atomic_buffer(void* ptr, size_t len, int cuda_device) override;
   LocalConnInfo local_info() const override;
